{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06534","headline":"效古二首 二 · 储光羲","name":"效古二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东风吹大河，河水如倒流。\n河洲尘沙起，有若黄云浮。\n赬霞烧广泽，洪曜赫高丘。\n野老泣相语，无地可荫休。\n翰林有客卿，独负苍生忧。\n中夜起踯躅，思欲献厥谋。\n君门峻且深，踠足空夷犹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06534.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06534","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}